  ("Why Grades 1 to 3 and not Grades 4 to 6?", "Decoding is learned in the first three years, and a child who has not learned it falls behind in every subject. The MATATAG curriculum puts foundational skills first in Key Stage 1."),
  ("Why English reading? Why not Filipino or the mother tongue?", "Our speech service and the curriculum codes we used are English. Grade 1 mother-tongue instruction is real, and we list it as a limitation and a future step: we would need a Filipino speech model and Filipino content."),
  ("Does this replace the teacher?", "No. The teacher confirms every activity, decides its level, chooses what to assign, and reads every alert's evidence. Results assist a teacher's judgment."),
