  ("What are Independent, Instructional and Frustration?", "For word reading in one passage: Independent 97 percent or more (reads alone comfortably), Instructional 90 to 96 (learns with a teacher's guidance), Frustration under 90 (too hard even with help). A Non-reader cannot yet recognize and sound out letters and simple words."),
  ("What is MATATAG?", "The revised basic education curriculum (DepEd Order No. 10, s. 2024). It is written by grade, with codes such as RL1PWS-I-5, sound out words accurately. We attach codes to the first-check texts, mistake patterns and activities."),
